It's called "savescumming".  Use save files to recover from real
crashes or to move the game from machine to machine and it
is not cheating.  Use save files to recover from mistakes or
deaths and it is cheating.  That's what explode mode is for.

It turns out that no matter how tempting savescumming is in
the end it interfers with learning the skills needed to advance
in the game.  Nethack is not about situation no matter how
much looking at the screen makes it look that way.  Nethack
is about information, planning in advance, and being prepared.
It is very common for an event on one level to put you in a
situation where you die several levesl later.  Pray too early so
your diety is angry with you, progress several more levels, get
into the type of trouble that prayer should help, and you're
dead from something that no amouont of savescumming will
fix.



